<title>JAPAN: BOJ drains 500 bln yen from money market--traders.</title>
<headline>BOJ drains 500 bln yen from money market--traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) drained a net 500 billion yen from the money market on Wednesday, money traders said.</p>
<p>The BOJ maintained its accommodative stance in the operation.</p>
</text>
